'''Mana Rune''' is a detrimental [[ground effect]]. The ground effect is cast by the [[Conquerors|Conqueror]] boss [[Baran, the Crusader]] and found in maps influenced by him.
[[File:Mana Rune Baran Arena.png|border|thumb|A active Mana Rune as seen in the Baran Arena]]
The Runes take a short amount of time once cast in order to activate and apply the [[debuff]] to the player.
[[File:Mana Rune Baran Arena inactive.png|thumb|A inactive Mana Rune as seen in the Baran Arena]]
Active '''Mana Runes''' "shine" brighter than their counterpart.
'''Mana Runes''' that have been activated only last for a certain amount of time before vanishing.
